{
 "about": "P45I T3: the overnight list in the order it is generated – P45G rounds 15–16, P45G retries (LOD, winding, broken precheck, close-word precheck), a 2nd prop for settings with one, the first two for settings with none, missing nouns of evals/play/p45d/missing.json by sentences, P45E/P45F retries, a 3rd and 4th prop. `group` says which; class: setting props are prop (or flat) whatever word their name carries, retries keep the class of their earlier list, the rest scripts/p37d/gen-list.mjs entryOf. Features in ops/gen3d/features.toml. Rounds 3+ in D:/caches/p45i/round<n>/list.json: seeds a2,b2,a3 (P45E–G used 0 and 1), the synonym round without the precheck.",
